<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Análise e Wallet - GoatPay</title>
    <style>
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        body { 
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; 
            background: #000000; 
            color: #ffffff; 
            display: flex; 
            justify-content: center; 
            align-items: center; 
            height: 100vh; 
            margin: 0; 
            animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-out;
        }
        .card { 
            background: #0a0a0a; 
            padding: 30px; 
            border-radius: 16px; 
            width: 100%; 
            max-width: 450px; 
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(255,255,255,0.05); 
            text-align: center; 
            border: 1px solid #222222;
        }
        .success { color: #ffffff; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .wallet-box { background: #000000; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #333333; word-break: break-all; margin: 20px 0; font-family: monospace; color: #ffffff; }
        p { color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="success">⚠️ Cadastro em Análise</div>
        <p>Seus dados foram enviados com sucesso para a GoatPay e estão passando por validação.</p>
        
        <% if (walletUrl) { %>
            <p><strong>Wallet URL da Subconta Criada:</strong></p>
            <div class="wallet-box"><%= walletUrl %></div>
        <% } else { %>
            <p style="color: #ef4444;">Subconta criada, mas o Wallet URL não foi retornado.</p>
        <% } %>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
